{
  "contract": "scene",
  "version": 1,
  "readme": "contracts/README.md",
  "description": "预览与导出必须字面一致的场景语义:t 时刻画面上有哪些层、按什么 z 序、谁是 base。后端 backend/tests/test_scene_parity.py 与前端 sceneModel.parity.test.ts 跑同一份语料。",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "empty-timeline",
      "why": "没有任何轨:两侧都必须给空层列表,而不是抛错或造一个空 base。",
      "assets": {},
      "tracks": [],
      "samples": [
        {
          "t": 0,
          "layers": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "single-base-track",
      "why": "最基本形态:唯一一条 video 轨上的片段就是 base,按 fill_mode 取景。",
      "assets": {
        "a": {
          "kind": "video"
        }
      },
      "tracks": [
        {
          "id": "t0",
          "kind": "video",
          "position": 0,
          "muted": false,
          "clips": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "asset_id": "a",
              "timeline_start": 0,
              "src_in": 0,
              "src_out": 5,
              "speed": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "samples": [
        {
          "t": 0,
          "layers": [
            {
              "clip": "c1",
              "track": "t0",
              "isBase": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": 2.5,
          "layers": [
            {
              "clip": "c1",
              "track": "t0",
              "isBase": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": 5,
          "layers": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "z-order-bottom-to-top",
      "why": "position 升序 = 时间线自上而下,所以 position 最大的是底轨=base;返回顺序必须 bottom→top(绘制序)。",
      "assets": {
        "a": {
          "kind": "video"
        }
      },
      "tracks": [
        {
          "id": "top",
          "kind": "video",
          "position": 0,
          "muted": false,
          "clips": [
            {
              "id": "cTop",
              "asset_id": "a",
              "timeline_start": 0,
              "src_in": 0,
              "src_out": 10,
              "speed": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "mid",
          "kind": "video",
          "position": 1,
          "muted": false,
          "clips": [
            {
              "id": "cMid",
              "asset_id": "a",
              "timeline_start": 0,
              "src_in": 0,
              "src_out": 10,
              "speed": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "bottom",
          "kind": "video",
          "position": 2,
          "muted": false,
          "clips": [
            {
              "id": "cBot",
              "asset_id": "a",
              "timeline_start": 0,
              "src_in": 0,
              "src_out": 10,
              "speed": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "samples": [
        {
          "t": 1,
          "layers": [
            {
              "clip": "cBot",
              "track": "bottom",
              "isBase": true
            },
            {
              "clip": "cMid",
              "track": "mid",
              "isBase": false
            },
            {
              "clip": "cTop",
              "track": "top",
              "isBase": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "muted-video-track-still-shows-picture",
      "why": "回归:轨道头的静音是喇叭图标,语义只关音频。曾经预览显示、导出整层丢失——给画中画轨静音会让那层画面在成片里消失。",
      "assets": {
        "a": {
          "kind": "video"
        }
      },
      "tracks": [
        {
          "id": "pip",
          "kind": "video",
          "position": 0,
          "muted": true,
          "clips": [
            {
              "id": "cPip",
